      "Frailty is **loss of physiological reserve across several systems** so that a minor stressor causes a disproportionate fall in function; **sarcopenia** (low muscle strength, confirmed by low mass, severe if performance is low - use **AWGS 2019** cut-offs in India) is its physical core, and undernutrition with inactivity is its modifiable driver - reversed by **progressive resistance exercise, 1.0-1.5 g/kg/day protein spread over meals, vitamin D repletion, deprescribing and treating the causes of poor intake**, not by appetite stimulants.",
